  startingNodeID: 0
  nodes:
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: 0
    nextNodeID: 1
    text: He must be here! Search every corner until you find him! How could he murder
      our mother? I will never forgive him for such a vile sin. I never trusted him...
      and now he's proven me right.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Alcippe
    leftSprite: {fileID: 0}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8bcf3012f0fe85743a688c311b9f52c7, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: 1
    nextNodeID: 2
    text: 'Alcippe...? She thinks I killed Mother... '
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Ceryx
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: 2
    nextNodeID: 3
    text: 'No... she''d never believe me. Not after everything... and not while I''m
      holding Mother''s brooch. '
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 0
    speakerName: Ceryx
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: 3
    nextNodeID: 4
    text: 'I need to escape before they find me..   '
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Ceryx
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: 4
    nextNodeID: 5
    text: Rookie! If you're done packing, you need to deliver this to Piraus. Walk
      north and climb the mountain.
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Carpus
    leftSprite: {fileID: 0}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 7150802143551903488, guid: bee79c88ac91e9e46bbb3243aa07f3f0, type: 3}
  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: 5
    nextNodeID: choices0
    text: 'I don''t have time to deliver all of this, but if I don''t, it will affect
      my relationship with Cranaus. What should I do? '
    choices: []
